Show Me What You Got for Horizon 26.3 (version 0.4.0)

A port of Show Me What You Got 1.1.1 by Apace.
Original source: https://github.com/apace100/show-me-what-you-got
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Horizon by lavoide: the rules are re-implemented in Rust as a Horizon native mod (the mod API plus
the [[native.mixin]] patches and game modules listed in horizon-mod.toml; no Java code is included). This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (MIT); the licence text is in LICENSE. Built
against Horizon's exact-build SDK dd67b76ff23e28c6d8e21859df600d31572f81a0.

LICENSE is the original jar's LICENSE_ShowMeWhatYouGot-1.20.
